Standards & Non-Affiliation Notice:
This software is an independent, open-source implementation that reads and writes a minimal subset of ASC X12 005010 transaction sets (850, 861, 810, 997, 820) and an x402-style HTTP 402 gate (not wire-compatible with the x402 spec), for B2B Accounts Payable 3-Way Match research and prototyping.
It is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or certified by ASC X12, PayPal, Inc., or the x402 project. No proprietary X12 dictionaries or schemas are bundled.

This product was built with substantial AI assistance. Gemini (Google),
through Google Antigravity, wrote most of the implementation and tests.
Claude (Anthropic), through Claude Code, performed independent review and
verification. Design, requirements, acceptance criteria and release
decisions: Carlos Fuentes.
